---
title: Projects
date: 2024-10-01
layout: base.njk

pagination:
  data: collections.projects  # Use the projects collection fetched from Contentful
  size: 1                    # Number of projects per page
  alias: project             # Alias for the current project in the loop
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
  permalink: "/pages/projects/project+{{ pagination.page }}/"
---
<h1>Our Projects</h1>
<p>At Cowhead Company and Associates, our projects focus on sustainable farming, ethical dairy production, and innovation. We prioritize eco-friendly practices, humane treatment of animals, and creating clean, high-quality dairy products. From sustainable farming methods to developing lactose-free options, we are committed to delivering responsible, environmentally conscious dairy that benefits both people and the planet.</p>
<p>Our projects throughout the years:</p><br>
<div class="project-container">

<div class="project-cards">
    {% for project in pagination.items %}
        <h2 class="project-title">{{ project.fields.title }}</h2>  <!-- Access project title -->

        {% set description = project.fields.description.content[0].content[0].value %}
        <p class="project-description">{{ description }}</p>  <!-- Access project description -->

        {% set slogan = project.fields.slogan.content[0].content[0].value %}
        <p class="project-slogan"><strong>Slogan:</strong> {{ slogan }}</p>

        {% set startDate = project.fields.startDate %}
        {% set endDate = project.fields.endDate %}
        <p class="project-date">{{ startDate }} to {{ endDate }}</p>  <!-- Access project start and end dates -->

        <!-- Access and display the image from Contentful -->
        {% if project.fields.image %}
            <img src="{{ project.fields.image.fields.file.url }}" alt="{{ project.fields.title }} image" class="project-image">
        {% else %}
            <p>No image available.</p>
        {% endif %}
    {% else %}
        <p>No projects found.</p>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- Pagination Controls -->
<div class="pagination">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}
        <a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}">Previous</a>
    {% endif %}

    <span>Page {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }} </span>

    {% if pagination.href.next %}
        <a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Next</a>
    {% endif %}
</div>
</div>
